# Cargo's build output for the harness.
#
# Needed here rather than in `src-tauri/.gitignore`: that file's `/target/` is
# anchored to `src-tauri/`, so it matches the shell's build directory and not
# this one. Without this file the harness's ~70 MB of objects show up as
# untracked and are one careless `git add -A` away from being committed.
/target/
